# Normalise line endings to LF in the working tree.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows rewrites LF blobs to CRLF on
# every `git checkout`, and `biome check` (formatter lineEnding: lf) then fails
# on files git considers unchanged — a loop where the lint gate flips red after
# any checkout and green after `biome check --write`, with no diff to commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be newline-translated.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
